{"id":"vod_sn_38909","vodId":"38909","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"结城友奈是勇者","name_cn":"结城友奈是勇者","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2489547a70224617a0b9dc1e23ac7ac6.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在神世纪300年，表面看来，结城友奈（照井春佳 配音）是一个平凡的初中二年级女生，个性开朗热情的她是校园中的活跃分子，深受老师和朋友们的喜爱。可实际上，放课后的她还有着另一重身份——勇者部的部员。　　友奈的邻居兼好友，沉默寡言却意外的温柔的东乡美森（三森铃子 配音）、个性大大咧咧果断直率，却意外的擅长做家务的犬吠埼风（内山夕实 配音）、风的妹妹，像小动物一样惹人怜爱的犬吠埼树（黑泽朋世 配音）、看似桀骜不驯难以接近，实际上非常害羞傲娇的三好夏凛（长妻树里 配音），除了友奈，活跃在勇者部的是这些性格迥异的女孩们，她们所要面对的，是名为巴提克的强大敌人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EFMEyjwhMy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i2xAxrH2hY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/isXfk9K2fW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T48jmB2TBL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mQMkUEYuSm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5XLaSfdJD11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dkS46kQpUr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wZuC3HuwdU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YKGxUQd5EB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y3XcDJ5FWf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qsGaXBrnVJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/giKFxbc00G1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:52.862Z"}